# Butler Routes - Redridge rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 8 confirmed rares and the fixed world
# containers of Redridge Mountains. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not
# up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever game
# data (questie-forever); the data records no loot on any of these eight rares,
# so there are no signature drops to chase. Respawn timers are unconfirmed
# anywhere, so none are stated. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or
# objective of any core-contracted quest. See
# docs/redridge-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory this guide was
# built against.
guide butler-routes-completionist/redridge-rares
title Redridge Mountains - Rares & Treasures
levels 14-26
zone Redridge Mountains
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords redridge, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

