  note Seventeen Battered Chest placements, twenty-six Solid Chest placements, eleven Barrel of Melon Juice placements (the matching Food Crate set shares those points), fourteen further Food Crate and Barrel of Milk placements, eight Waterlogged Footlockers in the lake, and one Sunken Chest. All hold ordinary low-level goods; no unique treasure confirmed.
  note The contracted quest Alther's Mill (98386) takes a Tarantula Egg objective; that egg is routed in the core guide, not here. Respawn timers unconfirmed.

step Lucius's Lockbox — Alther's Mill

  goto 46.95,44.69
  interact 121264 optional
  note A one-off lockbox by Alther's Mill. No quest in the data sends you to it; the contracted Rogue quest Alther's Mill (2282, core-routed) names no source for its token, and no link between the two is in the data. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

